   "fix": "move the artifact step after the upload it duplicates and give it `if: failure()`, so the file is kept only on a run where that upload failed; where the upload comes first, drop the artifact step",
   "tradeoff": "none while the other destination is browsable (code scanning shows the SARIF, the release its assets) and nothing downloads the artifact: no download-artifact step in this file does, but another workflow or a script fetching it by run is not visible here, so check for one before the step goes; keep the artifact for a destination that is not browsable",
   "example": "# after the step that sends results.sarif to code scanning\n- name: \"Upload artifact\"\n  if: failure()   # only when that upload failed\n  uses: actions/upload-artifact@...\n  with:\n    path: \"results.sarif\"",
   "confidence": "measured"
  },
